{"tmdb":1280076,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Pertiwi returns to her hometown after spending two decades in prison to rebuild her life. There, she finds power in things that have been abandoned: discarded electronic devices that mysteriously light up and a community of outcasts living on the fringes of society. But coming home also means confronting the four men who sent her to prison and now rule the village. Together with the outcasts, Pertiwi begins to uncover the darkness that still haunts the place - and the past she thought she had left behind.","directors":[{"name":"Kamila Andini","id":1515263}],"cast":[{"actor":"Putri Marino","role":"Pertiwi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2NXQ4fOQDWn53HAbGTJcvHRZ4li.jpg","tmdb":1891479},{"actor":"Christine Hakim","role":"Mak Ira","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f8K6wb7qf03Y82WadEB7N6X9G5M.jpg","tmdb":142016},{"actor":"Arya Saloka","role":"Bisma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ioRwfjaRoPls96kKN91IdsDipvD.jpg","tmdb":2112788},{"actor":"Hana Pitrashata Malasan","role":"Niken","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/g6ETjwEnzgoYpwb7zurcxyGCRE3.jpg","tmdb":2587281},{"actor":"Iswadi Pratama","role":"Pertiwi's Father","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5eTvtxQ8ayHyDhanvPHfjkpdR4R.jpg","tmdb":4256652},{"actor":"Hargi Sundari","role":"Pertiwi's Mother","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wAQ7VOok5CMUY1lO0zH7i6RJr40.jpg","tmdb":3010508},{"actor":"Shofia Shireen","role":"Teenage Pertiwi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lIwjqs3vLoBkOISOA7tBIPoyabL.jpg","tmdb":1683229},{"actor":"Nagra Pakusadewo","role":"Jonet","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qn173TWGBFhLRVBDejHeFmFVjAg.jpg","tmdb":3060088},{"actor":"Totos Rasiti","role":"Fajar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cFdp2N1wCrBZMlok6QFdu8Ly9aT.jpg","tmdb":1826302},{"actor":"Dwika Pradnyana","role":"Kuntet","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rErvULC6osLsyd4we2lgdWCTzRO.jpg","tmdb":5138378},{"actor":"Maryam Supraba","role":"Ra